sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Enterprise Developer
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant IAM as IAM Service
    participant Orch as Process Orchestrator
    participant Queue as Job Queue (SQS)
    participant Exec as Process Executor
    participant Proc as deep-compliance Service
    participant LLM as LLM Integration
    participant API as Anthropic API
    participant Store as Artifact Storage
    participant Webhook as Webhook Dispatcher

    User->>+Gateway: POST /v1/jobs<br/>{process_id: "deep-compliance", inputs: {...}}
    Gateway->>+IAM: ValidateToken(bearer_token)
    IAM-->>-Gateway: UserIdentity{tenant_id, user_id, permissions}

    alt Token Invalid
        Gateway-->>User: 401 Unauthorized
    end

    Gateway->>+Orch: SubmitJob(job_request)
    Orch->>Orch: Create job record (status: queued)
    Orch->>+Queue: EnqueueMessage(job_id, process_id, tenant_id)
    Queue-->>-Orch: Message ID

    Orch-->>-Gateway: JobResponse{job_id, status: "queued"}
    Gateway-->>-User: 202 Accepted<br/>{job_id, status, webhook_url}

    Note over Queue,Exec: Async Processing (2-24 hours)

    Queue->>+Exec: DeliverJob(job_message)
    Exec->>Exec: Load workflow.md, schemas
    Exec->>Exec: Phase 0: Context Assessment

    loop For Each Phase (0-6)
        Exec->>+Proc: ExecuteStep(phase_id, inputs)
        Proc->>+LLM: Complete(prompt, model: "claude-sonnet-4")
        LLM->>+API: POST /v1/messages

        alt API Rate Limit
            API-->>LLM: 429 Too Many Requests
            LLM->>LLM: Circuit Breaker OPEN<br/>Retry with exponential backoff
            LLM->>API: Retry after 60s
        end

        API-->>-LLM: Completion{text, usage}
        LLM-->>-Proc: Completion{text, tokens, cost}
        Proc->>Proc: Generate artifacts (YAML)
        Proc-->>-Exec: StepResponse{artifacts, gate_status}

        Exec->>Exec: Evaluate Gate Conditions

        alt Gate LOCKED
            Exec->>Orch: UpdateJobStatus(gate_locked, gate_id, failures)
            Orch->>+Webhook: JobEvent(gate_failed)
            Webhook-->>-User: POST webhook_url<br/>{event: "gate_failed", job_id, details}
            Exec-->>-Queue: NACK (move to DLQ)
            Note over Exec: Job terminates, manual intervention required
        end
    end

    Exec->>+Store: StoreArtifact(artifacts)
    Store-->>-Exec: artifact_ids[]

    Exec->>Orch: UpdateJobStatus(completed, artifacts_url)
    Exec-->>-Queue: ACK (delete message)

    Orch->>+Webhook: JobEvent(completed)
    Webhook->>Webhook: Sign payload (HMAC-SHA256)
    Webhook-->>-User: POST webhook_url<br/>{event: "completed", job_id, artifacts_url}

    User->>+Gateway: GET /v1/jobs/{job_id}
    Gateway->>+Orch: GetJobStatus(job_id)
    Orch-->>-Gateway: JobStatus{status: "completed", artifacts_url}
    Gateway-->>-User: 200 OK<br/>{status, progress: 100%, artifacts}

    User->>+Gateway: GET /v1/artifacts/{artifact_id}
    Gateway->>+Store: RetrieveArtifact(artifact_id)
    Store-->>-Gateway: YAML artifact
    Gateway-->>-User: 200 OK (application/yaml)
